     "en": "A short story"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "Raju's street was cleaned every morning by municipal workers.\n\"Who pays for that?\" he asked."
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "explain",
    "type": "explanation",
    "provenance": "original",
    "keepEnglishTerms": [
     "municipality",
     "tax",
     "ward"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Urban local bodies include the Nagar Panchayat, Municipal Council and Municipal Corporation. They provide water, roads, street lights, drains and garbage collection.\nMoney comes from taxes such as property tax and from government grants.\nCitizens have duties too: pay taxes, do not litter, save water and report problems to the ward councillor."
    }
